== FIX ROUND 2026-11-26: physical unicast NIC selection (review defects 1-3) ==

-- defects proved by adversarial review against a faked /sys/class/net --
1. multicast MAC accepted: enp1s0 01:00:5e:00:00:02 + ens3 -> picked the multicast.
2. Linux bridge with en/eth-prefixed name accepted: enbr0 with bridge/ + ens3 -> picked bridge.
3. container veth named eth0 accepted: no /sys/class/net/eth0/device, ip -d link = veth.

-- fix --
new seam: int dcu_comm_info_scan(const char *net_root, dcu_comm_info_t *out)
in cmd/dcu/dcu_comm_info.h; dcu_comm_info_read -> scan("/sys/class/net", out).
criteria: type==1, no wireless/, no bridge/, device link present, MAC nonzero and
I/G bit (mac[0] & 0x01) clear.
unchanged: eth0 first, else lexicographically smallest qualifying port; multi-port
index ordering (eth2/eth10, review A) HOLD, shortcut comment kept.

-- red (see red.log) --
test commit 230c9c20 on 31513dd0: undefined reference to dcu_comm_info_scan.
old-criteria extraction: 4/53 fail (multicast-only, multicast+physical, en-named
bridge, veth eth0); 49/53 pass.

